<view class="page">
  <view class="row" bindtap="onQuality">
    <text>导出清晰度默认</text>
    <text class="value">{{qualityText}} ›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="block-title">抠图服务</view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="onProvider">
    <text>Provider</text>
    <text class="value">{{providerText}} ›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="field">
    <text class="field-label">Hivision baseUrl</text>
    <input
      class="field-input"
      placeholder="https://your-host:8080"
      value="{{mattingBaseUrl}}"
      bindinput="onBaseUrl"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="field" wx:if="{{provider === 'webhook'}}">
    <text class="field-label">Webhook URL</text>
    <input
      class="field-input"
      placeholder="https://your-webhook/matting"
      value="{{mattingWebhookUrl}}"
      bindinput="onWebhookUrl"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="onToggleAuto">
    <text>证件照进入时自动抠图换底</text>
    <text class="value">{{autoMatteText}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="btn btn-primary save-btn" bindtap="onSaveMatting">保存抠图配置</view>

  <view class="block-title">弱美颜</view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="onBeautyMode">
    <text>默认美颜模式</text>
    <text class="value">{{beautyModeText}} ›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="field">
    <text class="field-label">美颜服务 baseUrl（可空，空则复用抠图地址并尝试 /beautify）</text>
    <input
      class="field-input"
      placeholder="可留空，使用本地轻处理"
      value="{{beautyBaseUrl}}"
      bindinput="onBeautyBaseUrl"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="onToggleAutoBeauty">
    <text>证件照抠图后自动弱美颜</text>
    <text class="value">{{autoBeautyText}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="btn btn-primary save-btn" bindtap="onSaveBeauty">保存美颜配置</view>

  <view class="row">
    <text>版本</text>
    <text class="value">0.3.0-beauty</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text>关于</text>
    <text class="value">最美证件照 · 全能修图</text>
  </view>
  <view class="hint label-sm">
    抠图走 Hivision 兼容 API。弱美颜默认「本地轻处理」（离屏画布磨皮/提亮，会改像素）；若配置了 baseUrl 会先试 /beautify，没有该接口则回退本地。证件照默认合规弱档。未配置且画布不可用时会明确报错，不会假成功。
  </view>
</view>
